+# Plan
+
+1. Change category deletion to resolve the category within the requested merchant store and return `ResourceNotFoundException` for missing or foreign ids.
+2. In the category service, collect the root and all descendants, load products associated with any of those category ids, remove only those category objects from each product's category set, and persist the products. Never delete a product.
+3. Delete the complete category subtree after product/category join rows have been removed, preserving the existing category-description and child cleanup behavior.
+4. Make the deletion operation transactional and add focused regression coverage for product retention, surviving category memberships, subtree removal, product/category listing, GET-by-id 404, and missing-delete 404.
+5. Build the affected modules and run the targeted tests, then run a broader Maven test/build check if practical.
